rwtest 1
test "Baby drain creates bond" project="Bernael" group="Bond" created=2026-09-18T00:00:00

# CompAbilityEffect_SoulDrain.Apply asks SoulUtility.TryConvertBaby first and
# returns when it answers yes. So a baby is never drained, it is adopted: the
# xenotype is overwritten, blood relations are cut, a Parent relation to the
# drainer is added and BabyBondUtility.EstablishBond hangs BX_BabyBond_Feeder on
# the drainer and BX_BabyBond_Victim on the baby.
#
# The whole BabyBond subsystem had no test at all. This is its entry point -
# the only caller of EstablishBond outside the bond code itself.
#
# BX_Blindness on the baby is the proof of the conversion: it comes with
# BX_DepravedHead, which the baby only has once it carries the xenotype.
# BX_SoulDrained absent is the proof that Apply returned before DoDrain.
#
# The asserts follow the order of TryConvertBaby, so the first red one names the
# step that broke. The xenotype and its genes go on first, then the blood
# relations are cut, and EstablishBond runs last. Blindness missing therefore
# means the conversion never started; Blindness there without the bond means it
# died on the way - most likely in the relation loop, which reads
# relations.otherPawn.needs.mood.thoughts.memories without a null check and sits
# directly in front of EstablishBond. Read the asserts bottom-up and that
# failure looks like a bond problem instead.

requires dlc=Biotech
spawn Pawn:Colonist at 0,0 name="Bernael" xenotype=BX_Bernael
spawn Pawn:Colonist at 1,0 name="Baby" age=1

give "Bernael" resource=BX_SoulStarved value=0.1

# The drain is used the way a player uses it: the "Soul drain" gizmo, then a
# click on the baby. Bernael walks next to it and runs the 2 s warmup (120
# ticks) before Apply fires, so the first assert of the order waits for the
# conversion instead of reading it at once. 300 is warmup, the one-cell walk
# and slack. Everything TryConvertBaby does happens in that one Apply, so once
# Blindness is there the asserts below read a finished conversion.
select "Bernael"
gizmo "Soul drain"
target "Baby"
waitfor pawn "Baby" hediff=BX_Blindness expect=present ticks=300

assert pawn "Baby" hediff=BX_Blindness expect=present
assert pawn "Baby" hediff=BX_SoulDrained expect=absent
assert pawn "Bernael" hediff=BX_BabyBond_Feeder expect=present
assert pawn "Baby" hediff=BX_BabyBond_Victim expect=present
assert log clean
